<<The implementation projects URL and URLSearchParams through Components Platform>>: "Project URL and URLSearchParams through the Components Platform package"

<<The implementation includes caller-owned lifetimes and live iterators>>: "including caller-owned URL lifetimes, live search parameter iterators"

<<The implementation supports Interactive Server and WebAssembly>>: "Interactive Server and WebAssembly browser tests."

